{"id": "wwdc2019-427", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/427", "wordCount": 1503, "segments": [{"start": 13.0, "text": "Hello. I'm Hoyt, from the"}, {"start": 15.0, "text": "Turi team at Apple, and I'm here"}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "to tell you about the Create ML"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "Recommender."}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "Create ML Recommenders are a"}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "fantastic way to add"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "personalization and intelligence"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "into the user experience of your"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "Suppose I have a hiking journal"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "where I can log different hikes"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "I've taken and how much I like"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "or dislike each of them."}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "Wouldn't it be great if this"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "also recommended new trails for"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "me to try based on the"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "preferences I already expressed?"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "Or suppose I have a math quiz"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "app, where the user has to solve"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "a number of math problems in a"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "timed session."}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "It would make sense here to"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "choose the next problem to ask"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "based on which of the previously"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "problems the user got correct or"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "incorrect."}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "Or let's take a look at a"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "shopping list where I can list"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "out the ingredients I need to"}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "buy the next time I go to the"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "grocery store."}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "Now, this is really simple here."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "But if it suggested ingredients"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "that I may have forgotten, it"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "makes the experience more"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "engaging and interesting."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "My goal today is to enable you"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "to create these kind of user"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "experiences in your app through"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "the Create ML recommender."}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "Let's dive into how we're going"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "to do this and let's start with"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "the data."}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "Recommenders work by looking for"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "patterns in groups of items."}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "Back to the shopping list."}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "When I'm going to the grocery"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "store, it's likely I have a few"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "recipes in mind."}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "I want to buy the ingredients"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "for them and make something"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "delicious. And, well what are recipes?"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "They are groups of ingredients."}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "And it turns out this is a"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "perfect example of the kind of"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "data you can use for"}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "Recommender."}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "In fact, all you need to do here"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "is to take these recipes and"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "turn them into a table with a"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "group column and an item column."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "Each row here says that a"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "particular item belongs to a"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "particular group."}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "Now, here the groups are recipes"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "and the items are ingredients."}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "But this can be much more"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "general."}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "Let's go to the math quiz app."}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "Here, the group can be the"}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "particular session that a"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "problem was asked in."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "The item is the problem."}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "And, well, I need to introduce"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "one more concept here."}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "We need to be able to give the"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "model feedback."}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "We need to tell it which"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "problems the user got correct or"}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "incorrect."}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "And so the Recommender also"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "works with a rating column."}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "A rating is a measure of how"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "good or how desirable a"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "particular interaction is."}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "Here, we could assign a 1 if the"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "user got the problem correct, or"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "a 0 if they got it wrong."}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "Now, with the hiking app, the"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "data there has the user, has the"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "group being the user, the trail"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "being the item, and a rating"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "being an explicit feedback from"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "the user about how much they"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "liked or disliked that"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "particular trail."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "Now, in your app, you would"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "query it with the same kind of"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "data."}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "You would locally track these"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "interactions and you would feed"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "in a set of items or item rating"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "pairs to your model."}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "Your model would then recommend"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "new items based on the"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "preferences and patterns"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "expressed in your input data."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "Let's see this particular one in"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "action."}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "So, I have here a simple hiking"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "journal."}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "I don't have any hikes logged"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "yet and so it's actually"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "recommending popular items,"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "things that get consistently"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "high ratings."}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "Let's go see if there's any"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "interesting ones in here."}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "Well, I'm adventurous, let's try"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "this one."}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "Well, okay."}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "Actually too hot, too dry."}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "Didn't really like it."}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "So, I'm going to say it's not"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "for me."}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "Now, what we see here is that"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "this hiking journal has now"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "updated the hikes based on the"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "preferences I've expressed"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "already."}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "It's recommending different"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "landscapes."}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "Ah. This one looks really nice."}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "I grew up in Colorado."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "I love aspens, I love tall"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "mountains."}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "Let's try it. Okay. It was fantastic."}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "Loved it. And here the model is"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "learning more about my"}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "preferences now."}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "It knows I like mountains,"}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "rocks, and colorful foliage."}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "So, let's try another one."}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "There we go."}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "Now I'm exhausted."}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "Three hikes in one day."}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "That's quite a bit ."}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "Let's go back to the slides"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "here."}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "Now, I already showed you an"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "example of the type of data used"}, {"start": 315.0, "text": "to train this particular model."}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "Now I would like to dive into"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "how the Create ML Recommender"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "extracts the patterns from this"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "data and builds a model that you"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "can use in your app."}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "The Create ML Recommender works"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "by learning relationships"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "between the items."}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "What items tend to go with what"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "other items?"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "Let's suppose we have three"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "hikes here. Two of these are up tall, steep,"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "mountain peaks, possibly the"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "kind I would like."}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "And one of these is a nice"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "stroll by a sandy beach."}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "Now, that information is not"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "actually present in the model."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "All we have are hikers, trails,"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "and ratings."}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "However, if you like climbing"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "these tall mountain peaks, it's"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "likely you would give both of"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "these similar ratings."}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "And so what we would see in the"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "data is that the same hiker"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "would give each of these hikes"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "similar ratings."}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "Likewise, because you go out and"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "enjoy a nice stroll by the"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "beach, it doesn't necessarily"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "mean you want to climb a tall,"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "cold, windy mountain."}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "And, or vice versa."}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "And so you may give these two"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "trails different ratings."}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "The Create ML Recommender would"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "find these patterns in the data"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "and learn that these first two"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "hikes are similar to each other."}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "They tend to go together."}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "And the third one is different."}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "Now, when you throw all the"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "items into the mix, the"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "Recommender builds a graph of"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "which items tend to go with"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "which other items."}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "How they're all related."}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "And it's this graph that gets"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "packaged into your model."}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "All of the user data and the"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "group data present in your"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "training data is not explicitly"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "present in the final model."}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "Now, to do this in your app, the"}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "easiest way to build this model"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "is through the Recommender"}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "template in the Create ML app."}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "That, like all of the other"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "templates, guides you through"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "the process of loading your"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "data, building your model,"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "evaluating your model's"}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "performance, and exporting your"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "model to Core ML."}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "Now, if you want to do it"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "programmatically, this is also"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "possible through the Create ML"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "framework."}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "And here the process is the"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "same."}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "First we load our training data"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "from a CSV file or a JSON file."}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "We then specify what the group"}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "or user column, what's the item"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "column, and optionally, which is"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "the rating column."}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "If we have data that's not"}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "present in the training data, we"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "can evaluate how well our model,"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "how accurately our model can"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "anticipate those new data by"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "using the model evaluate method."}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "And finally, we can write this"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "model out to Core ML."}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "Now, in your app, you would"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "locally track the interactions."}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "If your model uses ratings, you"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "would track a dictionary of"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "items to ratings."}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "Otherwise, you would simply use"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "a list of items."}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "Then, you would construct the"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "input to your model by also"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "specifying how many items you"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "wanted to recommend."}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "And finally, your model will"}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "return a ranked list of"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "suggested items based on the"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "input preferences it believes"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "most go with your input set."}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "Let me wrap this up with a few"}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "final considerations here."}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "First, these models are very"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "flexible."}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "They can be used in many"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "scenarios that don't fall into"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "the traditional user, item,"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "rating system of recommenders."}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "We, I gave you several examples"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "here but I'm excited to see how"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "you as creative app developers"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "can incorporate this into the"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "user experiences of your app."}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "Second, these models shift with"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "your app. That means they're on the device"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "and they work offline and"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "they're fast."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "It's perfect for just adding"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "that touch of personalization"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "into your user experience."}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "Finally, because they are with"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "your app and work offline, that"}, {"start": 567.0, "text": "means they're also privacy"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "preserving."}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "That way you can guarantee to"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "your users that their data is"}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "secure, even though the app"}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "adapts and responds to their"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "preferences."}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "Finally, to wrap up this entire"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "session, you heard about some"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "amazing new advances in text"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "classification that allow us to"}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "take advantage of the semantic"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "meaning of the text, even with"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "the limited amount of input"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "data."}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "You also heard about the new"}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "activity classification, which"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "allows you to understand and"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "assign meaning to the motion and"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "activities of your user."}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "And finally, I just introduced"}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "the recommender which allows you"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "to personalize the user"}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "experience of your app into the"}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "many, many different ways."}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "For more information on any of"}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "these things, please visit the"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "website associated to this"}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "session, or come talk to us in"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "the lab tomorrow."}]}